  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roast the rocoto peppers in the oven for 30 minutes.",
    "In a pan, cook the ground beef over medium heat until browned.",
    "Add the chopped onion and minced garlic to the pan and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "In a bowl, mix the cooked beef, caramel sauce, emulsified manteca, turmeric, and salt.",
    "Stuff each roasted rocoto pepper with the beef mixture.",
    "Place the stuffed peppers in a baking dish and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the yellow dense Peruvian beef rocoto relleno hot.",
    "Garnish with fresh herbs if desired."
